# 🎫 Help Desk Troubleshooting Methodology

Today's troubleshooting approach:

```text
1. Gather Information
        ↓
2. Identify Possible Causes
        ↓
3. Start With Basic Checks
        ↓
4. Investigate the Root Cause
        ↓
5. Make an Authorized Change
        ↓
6. Verify With the User
        ↓
7. Document the Resolution
        ↓
8. Escalate if Necessary
```

The key principle is:

> **Do not make unnecessary changes before identifying the likely cause of the problem.**

